   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Standardiseringspilot</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Standards development pilot</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ett pilotprogram i East African Community. Huvudsyftet med programmet &#xE4;r att ge deltagande l&#xE4;nder inklusive EAC Sekretariatet k&#xE4;nnedom om kommande Carbon Footprint standard som planeras att g&#xE4;lla fr&#xE5;n 2012.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SIS is planning to carry out a project &quot;EAC region introduction to Carbon Footprints through standardisation workshops and pre-seminars&quot; in accordance with the enclosed project specification dated  2010-03-12 Enclosure 1. The primary object of the project/programme is to promote trade, mitigate carbon emissions and reduce poverty in the developing countries.</narrative>
  </description>
